cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this protocol in research, teaching, or a published workflow, please cite it."
title: "Universal Article Writer (論理記事工房)"
abstract: >-
  A portable, evidence-first protocol for writing and reviewing articles with
  any AI. It externalizes sources and claims into ledgers, builds an argument
  map, runs adversarial review, and checks citations before delivery.
authors:
  - name: "Universal Article Writer contributors"
version: "3.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-28"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - evidence-based writing
  - argumentation
  - citation verification
  - large language models
  - prompt engineering
  - critical thinking
  - research workflow
